# Native build output (Capacitor/Android, Tauri).
# Duplicated from the root .gitignore on purpose: `eslint.config.js` reads THIS
# file via includeIgnoreFile(), so without these lines eslint walks
# android/app/build/ — thousands of generated files, including the copied web
# bundle — and reports hundreds of errors in code nobody wrote.
/android/.gradle/
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/local.properties
/android/.idea/
/android/app/src/main/assets/public/
/src-tauri/target/
/src-tauri/gen/
